!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-kernel-constructor-named-bare-is-unresolved-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §3.3.1, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.12 (the kernel under meta, proposed)"
  description: """
    The kernel's constructors are members of its schema map `meta`, and core names none of them at its root, so
    a bare `integer_type` in a schema importing core names nothing: every name resolves from the root, with no
    lexical scope to reach into `meta`. The constructor is applied by its path, `!meta.integer_type`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
